          },
          {
            "content": "يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Let us praise the Lord:  for He with glory is glorified",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "Acwmen tw Kuriw@  endoxwc gar dedoxac;e",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "فلنسبح الرب لأنه بالمجد تمجد.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Greek Refrain",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قرار يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "He ascended to the heavens:  and sent to us the Comforter:  Spirit of truth, the comforter:  Amen.  Alleluia.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "a`nel;wn ic ouranouc@  axiton paraklyton@  to `Pneuma tyc `aly;iac@  Amyn.  =a=l.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "صعد إلى أعلى السموات وأرسل لنا الباراقليط روح الحق المُعزي.  آمين هلليلويا.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Marenhwc `e `P=o=c@  je qen ou`wou gar af[i`wou",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic Refrain",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قرار قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "afsenaf `e`pswi `e nivyoui@  afouwrp nan `mpiparaklyton@  Pi`pneuma `nte ]me;myi@  Amyn.  =a=l.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Greek",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "He made the two into one:  that is the heaven and the earth.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "Touc du`o `kticac ic `ena@  ton ouranon ke tyn gyn.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "جعل الإثنين واحداً، أي السماء والأرض.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Pentafer pi`cnau `nouai@  `ete vai pe `tve nem `pkahi.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Greek",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Come on all you peoples:  to worship Jesus Christ.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "Deute pantec `ila`i@  `prockunycwmen Iycou <rictw.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "تعالوا يا جميع الشعوب لنسجد ليسوع المسيح.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Amwini nilaoc tyrou@  `ntebouwst `nI=y=c P=,=c.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Greek",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "This is God our Savior:  and the Lord of everybody.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "Outoc ectin `o:eoc `oCwtyr `ymwn@  ke Kurioc pacyc carkoc@",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "هذا هو الله مخصنا ورب كل جسد.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Vai pe `Vnou] Pencwtyr@  ouoh `P[oic `ncarx niben@",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Greek",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "يوناني",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Three in one and one in three:  the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "Triac en monadi@  ke monac eb `tri `adi@  `oPatyr ke `oUioc ke to `agion `Pneuma",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "ثالوث في واحد وواحد في ثالوث الآب والابن والروح القدس.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Spirit of Truth, the comforter.  Amen.  Alleluia.",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "To `Pneuma tyc `aly;iac@  `amyn =a=l",
            "language": "Coptic"
          },
          {
            "content": "روح الحق المُعزي.  آمين هلليلويا.",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Coptic",
            "language": "English"
          },
          {
            "content": "قبطي",
            "language": "Arabic"
          }
        ],
        "isComment": true
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Ou`triac ecjyk `ebol@  `ecoi `nsomt ecoi `nouai@  `ete vai pe Viwt nem `Psyri nem Pi`pneuma e;ouab.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "columns": [
          {
            "content": "Pi`pneuma `nte ]me;myi@  `amyn =a=l.",
            "language": "Coptic"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
